{"id":"22df4f3e7d0489b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Normal Form Game","display":"df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game — ZFC Game4 Normal Form Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game — ZFC Game4 Normal Form Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-game]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game — ZFC Game4 Normal Form Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> (player set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec S\">\\(\\vec S\\)</span> (strategy-set family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u\">\\(\\vec u\\)</span> (payoff-function family, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both indexed families are genuine functions.  Each payoff is therefore a real-valued function on the common strategy-profile carrier, not merely a value attached to a relation having domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnc